<title>USA: JF Hartfield's Joseph Basile dead at 50.</title>
<headline>JF Hartfield's Joseph Basile dead at 50.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Joseph Basile, a dollar bond trader at JF Hartfield &amp; Co Inc, died Wednesday at Memorial Sloan-Kettering hospital after a long illness. He was 50.</p>
<p>Funeral details will follow as soon as they become available.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
